              "id": "4b87ce7a-2308-458a-be97-1fda13b4fc83",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Essays Upon Gaming</strong></em> is a dialogue written by Jeremy Collier, originally published in 1713."
            },
            {
              "id": "e0938d8a-1510-4353-b2a9-8331b2fc897a",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "b754827b-664c-45f0-ac03-359baa439be1",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>And to bring the Enemy to a more decisive Contest, 'tis your Method to conceal your Force, to give way a little at the first Shock, and retire Fighting.</em>"
            }
          ]
        },
